          "text": "Larkhollow Community Hospital · Medical Staff Office · Larkhollow, Washington Procedure version LARK-MSO-2026.1, in force from 2026-01-01. Approved by the Executive Committee of the Medical Staff. Maintained by the Medical Services Professional.",
          "start_index": 54,
