        {
          "text": "This procedure covers initial appointment only — a practitioner who has never held membership or privileges here. Reappointment, requests for additional privileges between appointments, credentialing by proxy, temporary privileges and emergency or disaster privileges run under separate procedures and are not described here.",
          "start_index": 300,
          "end_index": 625,
          "tab_id": "t.0"
        },
        {
          "text": "Where our rules come from, and how to tell them apart",
          "start_index": 626,
