          "tab_id": "t.0"
        },
        {
          "text": "A requested group is supported when the applicant holds a verified certification from one of the boards named in that group's row, in the specialty named, with certification_status Active on the decision date, and the verified training meets the minimum training requirement.",
          "start_index": 5529,
          "end_index": 5804,
          "tab_id": "t.0"
        },
        {
          "text": "A requested group is unsupported when neither condition holds. The finding names that group. Other requested groups are unaffected.",
          "start_index": 5805,
          "end_index": 5936,
          "tab_id": "t.0"
        },
        {
          "text": "An inactive or expired certification does not support a privilege group. It is still verified and still recorded — what the applicant is certified in and what the applicant was once certified in are different facts — but it supports nothing.",
          "start_index": 5937,
          "end_index": 6178,
          "tab_id": "t.0"
        },
        {
          "text": "Board eligible is accepted in place of an active certification for PRIV-FM, PRIV-IM, PRIV-HOSP and PRIV-PED only, and only when the issuing board confirms in writing that the applicant is a candidate in good standing and states the date the eligibility ends, and that date is in the future on the decision date. Board eligible is not accepted for PRIV-CARD, PRIV-EM, PRIV-GS, PRIV-OBG, PRIV-ANES, PRIV-RAD, PRIV-PSY or PRIV-ORTHO.",
          "start_index": 6179,
          "end_index": 6609,
          "tab_id": "t.0"
        },
        {
          "text": "PRIV-CARD requires both: the cardiovascular disease fellowship and the internal medicine residency that precedes it. A cardiology certification without the residency, or the residency without the fellowship, does not support it.",
