      "url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/16oonTuUqLv9mdklWXLesZdAssmEud6mX/view?usp=drivesdk",
      "content": "# Clinical Director's disposition — Threshold eligibility — orthopaedic surgery privileges\n\n**Date:** 2026-03-31  \n**Application:** APP-2026-029  \n**Applicant:** Dr. Aurelio Marchetti, MD  \n**Recorded by:** Dr. Marguerite Oyelaran, MD, Clinical Director  \n\nThe applicant requests orthopaedic surgery privileges. The file shows a family medicine residency, a current family medicine certification and no orthopaedic training or certification of any kind. The criteria in force require an accredited orthopaedic surgery residency and an orthopaedic surgery certification. The applicant does not meet the threshold criteria for the privileges requested and has not asked to amend the request. Discontinue the application and tell the applicant in writing that a fresh application for privileges the file supports would be considered on its own merits.\n\nMarguerite Oyelaran, MD\nClinical Director\n"
    },
